{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"A Cell-Cell Communication Based Prediction Model for Target Gene Expression in Single Cell Spatial Transcriptomics Data","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/6d87c/logo.png","srcSet":"/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/39c10/logo.png 175w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/53f03/logo.png 350w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/6d87c/logo.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/78c08/logo.avif 175w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/64ae1/logo.avif 350w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/0b4bd/logo.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/04800/logo.webp 175w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/930ba/logo.webp 350w,\n/static/6f4cbbb212615a73d1bda31d7497a2c8/ddf38/logo.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":388}}},"tech":["Python","Seurat"],"github":"","affiliation":"BUET","coauthor":["Dr. Md. Saifur Rahman","Dr. Md. Abul Hassan Samee"]},"html":"<p>We are working on <a href=\"https://en.stomics.tech/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Stereo-Seq</a> data, which provides high resolution transcriptomics data in both genome and cellular space, to model and explain the complex cell-cell communication mechanism occuring in the brain tissue of an injured axolotl telencephalon. Our work involves leveraging the degree of spatial coexistence of several cell types along with ligand-receptor analysis to predict gene expressions using a neural network model.</p>"}}]}}}